OL,3,GNEWSAExtremely rare red rainbow spotted
OL,4,Ain County Antrim
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn extremely rare red rainbow has been
OL,7,Fcaptured on camera in County Antrim.
OL,9,FPete Kirk spotted the sight in Mallusk
OL,10,Fon Friday morning and sent the photos
OL,11,Fto the BBC.
OL,13,FRainbows form when sunlight is bent and
OL,14,Freflected by water droplets in the air,
OL,15,Fsplitting the light into different
OL,16,Fcolours.
OL,18,FRed rainbows form in the same way, but
OL,19,Fappear at sunrise or sunset when the
OL,20,Fsun is low in the sky.
